 greeter/CMakeLists.txt |   6 ++
 greeter/greeterapp.cpp | 123 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 greeter/greeterapp.h   |   4 ++
 3 files changed, 132 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

